message: "If you reference the SVAF specification, please cite it as below."
title: "SVAF – Semantic Video Analysis Format"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "Schamane-MadMax"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Schamane-MadMax/SVAF"
license: MIT
version: "0.5"
date-released: "2026-08-19"
abstract: >-
  An event-based, audio-first format for converting audiovisual media into
  structured, searchable, storage-efficient, and RAG-ready knowledge
  representations. Defined by RFC-0001 (core specification) and RFC-0002
  (JSON Schema suite).
